{"v":4,"catch":"您能征服最險峻的地形嗎？","desc":"在 4x4 Adventure 中展開驚險刺激的越野旅程： Rocky Pathways 是一款終極 3D 越野體驗，讓您的駕駛技術受到考驗。在崎嶇不平的地形中穿梭、應付挑戰性任務，並在探險過程中征服各種不同的環境。\n\n在 4x4 Adventure： 在 4x4 Adventure: Rocky Pathways 中，您將在四個不同的環境中執行各種令人興奮的任務，每個環境都充滿障礙和機會。完成任務可賺取金錢，用來購買和升級一系列強大的車輛，增強您的越野能力。\n\n從岩石山丘到泥濘小徑，遊戲提供了動態且身歷其境的駕駛體驗。您能迎接挑戰，成為崎嶇山路的高手嗎？冒險在等待著您！","publisher":"TrueMotion Interactive","release":"2024-11-14","genres":["競速"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.4GB / Switch 0.4GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f76be7592d3df619708e3ec23abe6c7ed41b553e1bf2c86b4474ccbdfde3c4cd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/ee053c459a9eb206b6eed4bf8d81a3262b4de4461ecf3daa61438e65d293942d.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/563d52fcb2d26025b03edc2e67bb1ebd539224c00f89b67fd3b947bf56b38e66.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/2557650c4d635dc0a31b4ba874f6be6820c1a759804ceef02bbb3620ebe0d657.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1aa309981326e1a81ac284a194946ebd9f41b391396afbd1bfed2d5186f9ac1b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7a5663ee26365114bd124c2fd0148c1a8f8dcd7ce40563b0b1910b821cf930bc.jpg"],"titleId":"0100c6c0208e6000","dlc":[]}